SUMMARY:Discovery Drop In & Storytime
DESCRIPTION:Every Thursday from April 9 to May 28\nStories at 10:30 & 11:30 a.m. in the Story Circle; drop-in activities from 10 a.m.-noon \nJoin us for a story time and some self-guided activities at the Charlotte Brody Discovery Garden. Story times will begin at 10:30 and 11:30 a.m. each Thursday morning in the Story Circle in the Discovery Garden. Activities for caregivers to enjoy with their youngsters will be available on the picnic tables in the same garden area. \nFee: Free; parking fees apply. No registration required.
URL:https://gardens.duke.edu/event/discovery-drop-in-storytime-12/
LOCATION:Duke Gardens – Charlotte Brody Discovery Garden\, 420 Anderson Street\, Durham\, NC\, 27708\, United States
CATEGORIES:Family programs
